sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Your App
    participant User as User Browser
    participant Aura as Aura Auth Server
    participant Firebase as Firebase Auth

    App->>User: Redirect to /v1/oauth/authorize
    User->>Aura: Visit authorization page
    Aura->>Firebase: User logs in (Google/Apple)
    Firebase-->>Aura: Firebase ID token
    Aura->>Aura: Exchange token for uid
    Aura->>User: Redirect to App Home URL
    User->>App: ?uid=USER_ID&state=STATE
    App->>App: Store uid for API calls